.el .ds Aq '
.TH FATHOM_EVENTS 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-events \- Read the analysis event stream a run wrote: what happened, in order (`e6.7`)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom events\fR [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-tail\fR] [\fB\-\-on\fR] [\fB\-\-path\fR] [\fB\-\-explain\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read the analysis event stream a run wrote: what happened, in order (`e6.7`)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<ROOT>\fR [default: .]
The repository to read the stream of
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the raw JSONL instead of one line per event
.TP
\fB\-\-tail\fR \fI<N>\fR
Print only the last N events
.TP
\fB\-\-on\fR \fI<PATTERN>\fR
Which kinds to print, repeating or comma\-separated: `analysis.*`, `detector.finished`, `*`
.TP
\fB\-\-path\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Read this file instead of the repository\*(Aqs configured stream
.TP
\fB\-\-explain\fR
Print where the stream is, whether it is switched on, and what was refused — then leave
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
